{{disambig msg|the floor-based spike hazards|the spiked, ball-like hazards|Spikeball|the active, enemy-like hazards|Poky}}

[[file:Spikes.png|50px|link=]] [[file:Womb Spikes.png|50px|link=]]
* Can be walked over, but will damage Isaac in the process.
* Deal one heart of damage upon contact with the player (unless the player has {{t|Callus}}, {{i|Orphan Socks}}, the ability to jump, or [[flight]] to avoid being damaged). Non-flying enemies take 8 points of damage.
** {{r|Sacrifice Room}} spikes will damage Isaac and enemies even with flight ability.
* {{dlc|a}} They can be deactivated with {{e|Pressure Plate|n}}s.
* {{dlc+|r}} Will retract if Isaac holds {{t|Flat File}}, even if they're sacrifice room spikes.{{dlc-}}

== Retractable Spikes ==
[[file:retractingspikes.gif|50px|link=]]
* Retract and extend on timers.
* Can be walked over safely while they are retracted.
* Can be destroyed by placing {{i|The Poop}}'s poop on them while they are retracted and then clearing the poop.
* {{dlc|a}} Deactivates when all {{e|Pressure Plate|n}}s are pressed.
